1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,600
I'm your China Travel Expert.

2
00:00:01,600 --> 00:00:04,000
In China you don't hail taxis — you tap.

3
00:00:04,000 --> 00:00:06,200
The app everyone uses is DiDi.

4
00:00:06,200 --> 00:00:08,400
It has a full English version.

5
00:00:08,400 --> 00:00:10,800
Best in 2026: open DiDi inside Alipay.

6
00:00:10,800 --> 00:00:13,200
It links your foreign Visa or Mastercard.

7
00:00:13,200 --> 00:00:15,600
Type your address, or just drop a pin.

8
00:00:15,600 --> 00:00:18,000
Double-tap if this just saved your trip.

9
00:00:18,000 --> 00:00:20,600
At airports, walk to the green-dot zone.

10
00:00:20,600 --> 00:00:23,000
Your driver asks your phone's last four digits.

11
00:00:23,000 --> 00:00:26,000
★ Expert Tip: Set up DiDi on home Wi-Fi before you fly.

12
00:00:26,000 --> 00:00:28,600
Follow your China Travel Expert — one China secret daily.
